# Vouched and denounced GitHub users for AgentLayer.
#
# Policy:
# - Issues are allowed from anyone except denounced users.
# - Pull requests require a vouch unless the author already has write access.
# - Request a vouch in Discord: http://humanlayer.com/discord
#
# Maintainers can update this file directly or use the Vouch workflows by
# commenting one of the following on an issue or discussion:
# - vouch @username
# - denounce @username optional reason
# - unvouch @username
#
# Syntax:
# - One handle per line, without @, sorted alphabetically.
# - Prefix with github: if you want to be explicit.
# - Prefix with - to denounce a user.
# - Optional details may follow after a space.
#
# Seed this file with any trusted external contributors before opening the
# repository to the public.

